# Datagen hash cache (not part of the mod)
src/main/generated/.cache/

# NOTE: src/main/generated/ is intentionally NOT ignored.
# fabric-loom's configureDataGeneration() ships it inside the mod jar,
# so the datagen output must stay committed for a clean clone to build a
# working mod. Regenerate it with `./gradlew runDatagen`.
